# interval follows how often each feed's dep_delay actually changes: aomori's
# feed (and ODPT's mirror of it, which republishes about every 30s) changes
# within 30s more often than not, so it polls at 30s; the mcapps.jp feeds
# rarely change within 30s, so 60s loses almost no real signal while roughly
# halving RT archive volume.
# aomori polls ODPT's public, key-less mirror of the operator's own feed (same
# producer, same trip_ids): aomoricitybus.com drops this collector's address.
# id	name	interval	feed_url	static_url	ping_url
1	aomori	30	https://api-public.odpt.org/api/v4/gtfs/realtime/odpt_AomoriCity_AllLines_trip_update		https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-1
8	hiroden	60	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/realtime/8/trip_updates.bin	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/static/8/current_data.zip	https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-8
9	hirobus	60	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/realtime/9/trip_updates.bin	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/static/9/current_data.zip	https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-9
10	hiroko	60	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/realtime/10/trip_updates.bin	https://ajt-mobusta-gtfs.mcapps.jp/static/10/current_data.zip	https://hc-ping.com/FILL-ME-10
